<title>FINLAND: Finnish July PPI rise 1.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish July PPI rise 1.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index rose 0.4 percent in July on June, and it rose 1.1 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>		July 1997	    June 1997	 July 1996</p>
<p>Mth/Mth	+0.4 pct	     +0.3 pct	  -0.6 pct</p>
<p>Yr/Yr	  +1.1 pct	     +0.2 pct	  -0.7 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
